      "name": "[Blueprint][Norma] Grand Finale - Lv. 50",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of Norma's exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: Etheric Phantom: Scorpse deals 50% more DMG.\nWhen another squad member uses an <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color>, Norma <color=#2BAD00>immediately gains 100% Preheated Chamber</color>. This effect can trigger once every 40s.\nWhen any Agent uses a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>, that Agent's <color=#2BAD00>Decibel Generation Rate increases by 25%</color> for 15s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
